---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { findReleaseArtifact, normalizeReleaseManifest } from "@lensflow/contracts";
import releaseFeed from "../../public/latest.json";
import betaFeed from "../../public/beta.json";
const manifest = normalizeReleaseManifest(releaseFeed);
const beta = normalizeReleaseManifest(betaFeed);
const published = manifest.status === "published";
const artifact = findReleaseArtifact(manifest, "github-zip");
const releaseDate = published && manifest.publishedAt ? new Intl.DateTimeFormat("zh-CN", { dateStyle: "long", timeZone: "Asia/Shanghai" }).format(new Date(manifest.publishedAt)) : "尚未发布";
const formatBytes = (value?: number) => value ? `${(value / 1024 / 1024).toFixed(1)} MB` : "未提供";
---
<SiteLayout title="下载｜镜序 Lensflow" description="下载 Lensflow Chrome 扩展并查看手动安装和升级说明">
  <main><section class="page-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">DOWNLOAD</span><h1>安装到桌面 Chrome</h1><p>首版通过 GitHub Release 提供可审查 ZIP。Chrome Web Store 地址在真实发布前不会显示。</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-band"><div class="release-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">{published ? "LATEST STABLE" : "UNRELEASED"}</span><h2>{published ? `v${manifest.version}` : "尚无稳定版"}</h2><p class="release-status">{published ? "该版本由标签工作流构建，并附带哈希与构建来源证明。" : `计划版本 v${manifest.version} 尚未创建 Release，当前不提供虚构下载。`}</p><div class="release-meta"><div><span>发布时间</span><strong>{releaseDate}</strong></div><div><span>安装包大小</span><strong>{formatBytes(artifact?.sizeBytes)}</strong></div><div><span>最低 Chrome</span><strong>{manifest.minimumChrome}</strong></div><div><span>数据版本</span><strong>v{manifest.dataVersion} · 最低 v{manifest.minimumDataVersion}</strong></div><div><span>桥接协议</span><strong>v{manifest.bridgeProtocol}</strong></div><div><span>迁移要求</span><strong>{manifest.migration.required ? "需要迁移" : "无需迁移"}</strong></div><div class="release-meta-wide"><span>SHA-256</span><strong class="release-hash">{artifact?.sha256 || "发布后生成"}</strong></div></div>{published && artifact ? <a class="button primary" href={artifact.url}>下载扩展 ZIP</a> : <a class="button" href="https://github.com/AJ-nb/lensflow/releases">查看 GitHub Release</a>}{published && manifest.notesUrl && <a class="release-notes-link" href={manifest.notesUrl}>查看更新说明</a>}<div class="beta-channel"><span>BETA CHANNEL</span><strong>{beta.status === "published" ? `v${beta.version}` : "暂无公开测试版"}</strong><small>测试版使用独立清单，不会触发稳定版更新提示。</small>{beta.status === "published" && findReleaseArtifact(beta, "github-zip") && <a href={findReleaseArtifact(beta, "github-zip")!.url}>查看测试版</a>}</div></div><div class="prose"><h2>ZIP 手动安装</h2><ol><li>下载 ZIP 并校验 Release 页面中的 SHA-256。</li><li>解压到固定目录，不要直接从压缩包运行。</li><li>打开 <code>chrome://extensions</code>，启用开发者模式。</li><li>选择“加载已解压的扩展程序”，指向包含 manifest.json 的目录。</li><li>升级前先导出备份，再覆盖原目录并点击重新加载。</li></ol><p class="notice">ZIP 用户每 24 小时最多检查一次公开稳定版清单，只显示提醒并打开本页。Chrome Web Store 安装继续由商店自动更新，Lensflow 不绕过浏览器限制。</p><p class="notice">不同扩展 ID 无法直接共享 IndexedDB。迁移时使用旧插件导出、新插件导入；API Key 永不导入。</p></div></div></section></main>
</SiteLayout>
